TITLE Pure water pH 7, 150C, eq with chrysotile and talc
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Chrysotile 0 10
    Talc 0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.tsv
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Si_species_count
    10 PUNCH TOT("Si")
END
